      "statement": "Gadget facets are restarted by deliberate aborts: bumpVersion aborts affected facets after a code update (binding-only changes restart only the touched gadget), getGadgetFacetFetcher tracks #runningChatIds and aborts the facet whenever the requested chat context (mainline vs a chat's proposed changes) differs from what is running, and proposedChangesChanged aborts facets running the modified chat's code whenever the chat's changes change.",
