      "statement": "On collaborator removal or downgrade the whole Overseer DO is restarted (after storage.sync, delayed ~100ms so the triggering response lands) because authorization is only checked at open(); the abort disposes each session's notifyClosed stub without calling it, which the server detects as a lost connection and converts into a browser WebSocket reconnect that re-runs open() against the changed permission graph.",
